{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/21/1064111/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"きのうは\nせっちゃんと一緒に\n一夜を過ごしました(・∀・)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんは！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"第23回 信濃の国 楽市楽座\n〜ファミリーで楽しむ秋〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"に出演させていただきました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ライブは2回で\nそのうち1回の前半は\nテレビで生中継をさせていただきました(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"セトリ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"走れ！Bicycle\nおいでシャンプー\n−MC−\n涙が悲しみだった頃\n狼に口笛を\n左胸の勇気\n−MC−\nぐるぐるカーテン\n会いたかったかもしれない"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中田の立ち位置は"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"涙が悲しみだった頃→ゆっきーな\n狼に口笛を→まいまい\n左胸の勇気→若月"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"で、あとはいつもの位置でした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中田の一周年記念動画でも言いましたが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"沸いてましたよね？←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来てくださったみなさん\nありがとうございました＼^^／\nほんっと楽しかったです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ライブの他には\nまりちゃ、ろってぃー、中田の3人で"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"夢テレビ2012\nスマイルダンスコンテスト\n決勝大会"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"のほうにも出させていただきました(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どのグループも\nダンスがもうレベル高すぎて\nただただやばかった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/21/1064111/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂もダンスがんばらなきゃいけないですね、ほんとに＞＜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと、共演させていただいた"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アップアップガールズ（仮）さん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂に入る前に\nライブを見させてもらったことあるくらい\n好きなので\n今日は共演させていただき高まりました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/21/1064111/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うん、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はいい一日だったなあ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かな￣(=∵=)￣"}],"source":"archive"}